'''Meran''' is a continent on [[Basis]]. 

==Etymology==

==History==
{{Main|History of Meran}}

===Chronology===
*Stone Age (before {{abbr|8000 BCE|6646 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}}): Early humans arrive (or were already there?)
*Neolitic (c. {{abbr|8000 BCE|6646 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – {{abbr|5000 BCE|4153 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}}): Early farming societies emerge in the [[Auser civilisation]] and [[PROTO-OTTELIA]]. 
*Copper Age (c. {{abbr|5000 BCE|4153 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – {{abbr|2400 BCE|1994 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}}): TBD
*Bronze Age (c. {{abbr|2400 BCE|1994 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – {{abbr|1000 BCE|831 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}}): Development of writing, cities, and dynasties in the [[Auser civilisation]] and [[Ottelia]]
*Iron Age (c. {{abbr|1450 BCE|1205 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – {{abbr|350 BCE|291 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}}): The [[Byrakans]] establish large, fortified, town-like settlements in [[Northern Meran]]. The [[Cunerian Empire]] is founded and wages wars against the Byrakans and the Ottelians. 
*Ottelian period (c. {{abbr|350 BCE|291 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – {{abbr|296|246 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}): The [[Ottelians]] dominate Southern and Northern Meran, following the [[Byrakan Wars]]. 
*Sukats period ({{abbr|296|246 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – {{abbr|1100|914 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}): The [[Sukats]] dominate Northern Meran and expand throughout Meran, invading [[Byrak]], [[Ottelia]] and [[Cuneria]]. 
*Medieval period (c. {{abbr|1100|914 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – {{abbr|1800|1495 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}): Fragmentation of [[Sukatia]] which breaks up in the [[Eastern Sukatian Empire|Eastern]] and [[Western Sukatian Empire]]. 
*Post-medieval period (c. {{abbr|1800|1495 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – c. {{abbr|2200|1828 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}): [[Holaria]], [[Prugundy]], [[Qym]] and [[Thyon]] emerge as dominant powers in Meran. End of this era marks the end of absolutism, except in Qym where it endures. 
*Industrial/Modern (c. {{abbr|2200|1828 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – Present): [[Holaria]] invades [[Tamodia]], starting the [[Boreal War]].

==Geography==
===Main regions===
*[[Southern Meran]] ([[Prugundy]], [[Thyon]])
*[[Northern Meran]] ([[Afarut]], [[Gosaria]], [[Imendia]], [[Nykal]], [[Qym]], [[Tamodia]])
*[[Western Meran]] ([[Holaria]])
*[[Eastern Meran]] (areas east of Prugundy, Gosaria and Imendia)

